    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Patrizia D'Antonio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113381197579642419423/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxaaZeBxWSBdIFdfQU0Acvvq25VYSUy01AfGnuNMnJeNwJ6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "We are extremely pleased and satisfied with your teams exceptional service from start to finish. A special thank you to Melissa !",
        "time": 1769045213,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amélie Crasci",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106270191021634262931/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKOBXcu03_erEbtAhNQ_YEOq2iEtZkTLoOnkd1CpwePp7W_tvU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "It's been about a year since I finished my Invisalign treatment with Dr. Amy and Dr. Paul, and I am still as satisfied as I was when walking out of my last appointment! My treatment was over a year long and at times it was challenging to follow, but it was well worth the wait. My teeth are straight and I'm proud of my smile! I got wires installed and a retainer to wear at night, to ensure my teeth stay in place after my treatment, and I'm happy with my choice. Admittedly, there are nights when I do not feel like wearing my retainer but I know it helps and I'm reassured with the wires, which were recommended to me by Dr. Amy & Dr. Paul. They are truly experts in what they do, they give their honest advice, they care about their patients, and they are a delight to be served by! I was also served with much respect by their very hospitable and professional staff who made my experience going into the clinic and booking my appointments an absolute breeze. Thank you so much! :D",
        "time": 1756482286,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrea C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114392453796763310145/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU8hqvUBMhs32H1Y81xO17N-58Ep98gwwNZaLKuZFRhO2r2s6b7BQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Always the best service and my kids are well taken care of.  The personalized treatment at A&M is like nothing else we've experienced.  The entire staff is so welcoming and we always feel safe. Hands down the best orthodontists in our area 😃",
        "time": 1754999955,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nathalie Viau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100728231925599924966/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqR-2iJvIk9XFEVOImqd_tKl6M6IK8Vrv-m-rAPHfmgNUHUQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Strongly recommend A&M Orthodentistes. Dr. Archambault, Dr. Morton, and the entire team are attentive, knowledgeable, and compassionate. I’m truly grateful for their patience, professionalism, and the exceptional care they’ve provided.",
        "time": 1754411198,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "kimmacedo macedo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108630886820634818704/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZ-pO2cb2tu8zQ7TqBfuyJKiBWehxN11pQA-R8-MziLP4LSQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "My husband Mathew and my son Mateo Garcia are patients at A & M orthodontics and the service and experience is so pleasant. Really have that family vibe and how the two dentist remember their patients personally is incredible. By far best ortho clinic around. Highly recommend",
